{"version":1,"content":"<html>\n<body>\n<p>SitPose 是一款以溫和方式監測坐姿的智能教練，在你工作時從旁觀察背部狀況。它利用前置鏡頭與裝置端姿勢偵測，當你駝背或頸部前傾時，以聲音、語音提示或震動輕輕提醒你回到端正姿勢。適合長時間坐著工作、希望改善坐姿的人，原價 US $0.99，現正限時免費。</p>\n\n<h2>姿勢偵測與溫和提醒</h2>\n<p>SitPose 完全在裝置端運作，透過 Apple 的 Vision 框架即時分析姿勢，不會錄影、儲存或上傳任何影片。你可按照自己的良好姿勢校準，並分別調整頸部與軀幹的敏感度；它提供寬限期、站立提醒，亦會在你暫時離開時自動暫停，完成後以簡潔摘要呈現坐姿表現。</p>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-279-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-280-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-281-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-282-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-283-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<img alt=\"App Screenshot\" src=\"https://www.newmobilelife.com/wp-content/uploads/2026/08/1290x2796bb-284-scaled.jpg\"/>\n<ul>\n<li>應用名稱：SitPose – Posture Monitoring</li>\n<li>應用類別：Health &amp; Fitness</li>\n<li>下載位置：App Store</li>\n</ul>\n</body>\n</html>","scraped_at":"2026-08-25T22:00:55.953721+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":339,"images":6,"source":"New MobileLife","fallback":"none"}}